	<key>NSCameraUsageDescription</key>
	<string>HP Smart Printer uses your camera to scan documents and photos directly to PDF for wireless printing to HP, Canon, Epson, Brother, Lexmark, Xerox and all AirPrint printers.</string>
	<key>NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription</key>
	<string>HP Smart Printer needs access to your photo library to print photos and use images in PDF documents on any AirPrint-compatible printer.</string>
	<key>NSLocalNetworkUsageDescription</key>
	<string>HP Smart Printer needs local network access to discover and connect to AirPrint-compatible printers on your Wi-Fi — HP, Canon, Epson, Brother, Xerox, Ricoh, Kyocera, Lexmark, Samsung, Sharp, OKI, Konica Minolta, Pantum and more.</string>

